flowchart LR
  U[User]
  --> P[Portal / landing]
  --> L[SSO /login<br/>returnUrl]
  --> ST[Google start<br/>channel enabled]
  --> AU[Google authorize<br/>openid email profile]
  --> AP[Account picker]
  --> CB[SSO callback<br/>code + state]
  --> TX[Token exchange]
  --> UI[userinfo<br/>email + sub]
  --> M[Invite-only match]
  --> OUT[Deny googleError<br/>or redirectAfterLogin]
